Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, Greed's dead, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, and in a certain way, \Nthe way he died was just right for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:24.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unsightly yet beautiful in its violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, even if one of us is lost,\Nyou-know-who will just make another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:32.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, we've located a new Wrath.\NRight now, Sloth has him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what we should\Nmake him do...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.71,0:00:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're getting all sentimental over Greed dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something just crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do we come from, and where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.81,0:00:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a load.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Patrons...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:57.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to close\Nthe restaurant soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:00:59.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're alive here, now....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:01.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.19,0:01:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and we don't\Nneed to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.70,0:01:06.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat him? Can I eat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today, it's my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.39,0:01:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\NI've wondered about this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:33.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did I come from, and where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.11,0:01:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Jimmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.07,0:01:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!\NPlease let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.95,0:01:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, let me\Ntake a look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.13,0:02:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:11.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:19.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:22.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:42.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.03,0:04:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you sure\Nthis road is the right one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:40.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're definitely\Nheading south in any case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:43.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll come upon the\NIshbalan camp before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:45.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But will you actually learn anything from asking the Ishbalans?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:54.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have any other leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to be manipulated by those homunculus guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.27,0:05:04.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just now...\NI thought I heard\Na woman scream...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:20.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here you are, springing up right on time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that, you little runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been two years, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never thought\NI'd see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:54.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have so many things\NI want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:57.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But before that, I wonder\Nif you would tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:06:01.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you disappear\Nfrom before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you leave\Nwithout a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.75,0:06:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.\NIt was so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You taught me so many things!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:16.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemy and something even more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:19.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:21.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've never set foot outside of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I'm looking \Nfor a new Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:26.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You remember, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this Stone that you gave me, \Nour village was saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that disease has\Nbroken out again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and this Stone's power\Nseems to have gotten weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you lend me\Nyour help again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once more,\Nlike you did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:51.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mudslide, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.25,0:06:53.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This sure is quite a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:57.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:58.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:00.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should go on a bit of a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:07.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lucky girl, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.11,0:07:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deliver these herbs to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone is waiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.66,0:07:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there! There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:25.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:26.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:29.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Libia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:31.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lujon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:33.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:36.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you not to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This stuff won't\Ndo us any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:43.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised. You guys must've been riding in the carriage too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, you'd best get away\Nfrom here as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.81,0:07:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fossilitis is spreading\Nthroughout this whole area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:52.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fossilitis?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll cure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:57.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to \Ncure this with my...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:08:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with my alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you're traveling by yourself in order to find this man Lujon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:11.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what\Nyour reasons are,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it's really not good for a woman to be out alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the way things are going, I get the feeling that I'll never see Lujon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:28.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, why did this Lujon guy leave your village?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He left to search for\Na new Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Philosopher's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Stone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:39.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.53,0:08:43.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to cure the\Nfossilitis in our village,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:47.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he needs the power of the Stone, \Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:52.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is a terrible disease,\Nwhich no medicine has any effect on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is the reason why Lujon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:01.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will help you to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:04.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, you weren't \Nhurt that badly, for which I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:13.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Libia!\NWhat's the matter?\NAre you really hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My hand\Njust slipped a bit.\NLujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.15,0:09:19.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon, are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My son... My son...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:29.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is fossilitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The body suddenly begins changing into something like stone or dry wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:39.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People die, almost like\Nthey are withering flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:44.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave this boy, all that which is bringing calamity upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vasilisa, hear the cries of this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.64,0:09:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vasilisa, hear the grief of this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vasilisa, please accept this boy's prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy shall all be put to shame\Nand flee in terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:59.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They shall withdraw at once and be reproached.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.57,0:10:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:10.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anji...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:18.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He had... He had only\Njust turned eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:36.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:41.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I can do is pray to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.61,0:10:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vasilisa, my god, \NI ask that with your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you please spare the little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.57,0:10:49.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please spare her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, God...\NIshbala, my god...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:57.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I ask that with your power,\Nyou would please\Nspare this little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:10:59.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please spare them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're trying to use alchemy to\Ntake the dead parts of the body
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and reconstruct them back into a normal body, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:15.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that medicine won't work,\Nyou are not mistaken in your thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, you don't have\Nenough experience with alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will teach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:26.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,true alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.\NWho would've thought that you'd ever come to our village again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told them that I left the village to\Nsearch for a new Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but maybe I was \Nactually looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:56.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you again too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:12:02.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had this feeling\Nfor the longest time\Nthat I left something\Nbehind in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.\NWe're heading in the same direction anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not really sure it's right\Nfor me to go back to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What choice do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:18.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may be out looking,\Nbut you don't have any leads,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:20.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so there's not much else\Nyou can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:25.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By any chance, is this Lujon-san fellow your boyfriend, or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:27.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:29.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was dumped by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been in love with him\Nfor a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.43,0:12:36.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the one he is\Nreally in love with is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:41.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the place where you did your training, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:45.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It does indeed look like you've at least got a lot of books together here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most of this is junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:53.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, you have to acquire the correct knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Read these in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drill it all into your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use.\NThis is too hard for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:20.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:22.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have the talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There it is again...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.41,0:13:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why do I have these memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:19.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My gift to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:25.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This Philosopher's Stone\Nwill increase your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't start off with trying to heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try using your power to\Nreturn this bird to the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May God save this creature \Nand watch over it, never slumbering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Lord is this creature's keeper; the sun shall not smite it by day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nor the moon smite it by night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.78,0:14:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I told you,\Nyou have the talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.29,0:15:08.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:10.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:21.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could I ask you one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:26.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you disappear\Nfrom before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You knew how I felt \Nabout you, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.03,0:15:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't go looking\Nfor all the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.20,0:15:46.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will end up\Nbeing your ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:48.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:49.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:51.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, don't take Lujon...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:53.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't take Lujon away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:57.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He and I are engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:16:00.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once my fossilitis is gone, we're getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you invite me to the ceremony, I'll give a speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't joke around! I'm being serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia,\NI will use my power\Nto heal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:31.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May God save this woman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:33.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and watch over her,\Nnever slumbering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.67,0:16:36.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Lord is this woman's keeper;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:40.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the sun shall not\Nsmite her by day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nor the moon\Nsmite her by night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:54.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's incredible, Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:16:58.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cure my wife too!\NTake care of my kid too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:16:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it, Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.78,0:17:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.66,0:17:12.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.\NEverything is proceeding right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:14.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, that's the whole reason why\Nwe intentionally introduced this illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:22.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon is starting to heal the disease with the fake Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that will only last\Nfor the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next, I will take away\Nthe power that I gave Lujon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.43,0:17:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then he will fall into\Nthe depths of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and start seeking out\Na genuine Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.69,0:17:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he'll be doing it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been doing the same thing\Nall over the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,all to find us a person who can create a genuine Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:57.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Libia, you're even \Nprettier than usual today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:59.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, do you know\Nwhere Lujon is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just about time for\Nthe ceremony to start, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:05.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:10.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemy isn't the only thing that you taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.31,0:18:12.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something\Neven more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:14.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you by my side forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.19,0:18:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.03,0:18:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.67,0:18:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd better go to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.71,0:18:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:55.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you sure about this?\NI'm afraid of Envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:07.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're nearly at the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.95,0:19:10.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hang on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this new power...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:31.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over here! Over here!\NHurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:38.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've saved us again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:41.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,like you did two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.98,0:19:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.23,0:19:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That day,\Nwhen I hugged you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:53.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this will be\Ndifferent from then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:56.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go\Nthis time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:19:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:18.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were my small...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,blemish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did I come from, and where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:02.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.65,0:21:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:06.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:09.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.59,0:21:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.13,0:21:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.05,0:21:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.27,0:21:43.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...\Nwhat in the world is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.69,0:21:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 36: "The Sinner Within Us"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.43,0:23:46.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that anyone would be scared to see this mechanical arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.98,0:23:48.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course they would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.56,0:23:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However,\Nyour heart isn't\Nnecessarily always right.
